{"id":"fantasy-survival-diagnostic-bundle-LARGE-SINGLE-FILE-index-html","gameId":"fantasy-survival","target":"web","unityWebDevelopment":false,"department":"development","type":"implementation","designChange":false,"designScope":null,"proposedDesignChanges":[],"designFields":[],"assetProductionLane":false,"presentationPass":null,"graphicsReplacementContract":null,"motionRepairWorkUnit":null,"executionLane":"GAME_PRIMARY","goal":"[DIAGNOSTIC_BUNDLE] 같은 기능 경계의 관련 문제를 한 번에 해결한다.\n1. 대형 파일 전체를 다시 쓰지 말고 책임 코드 영역 1개만 찾아 최소 수정한다.\n각 수정 후 해당 파일의 접근성/모바일 입력/기본 성능·문법 안정성도 함께 확인한다.\n\n[WORK PACKAGE AUTO-EXPANSION]\n1. 직접 관련 오류 처리·예외 경로와 실패 피드백을 보강한다.\n2. 현재 책임 시스템과 인벤토리·진행·전투·상호작용 중 실제 연결된 경로의 상태 일치를 확인하고 발견 문제를 수정한다.\n3. 성공·실패·상태 변화 피드백을 실제 판정 시점과 맞추고 누락된 피드백을 보강한다.","responsibleFiles":["web-games/fantasy-survival/index.html"],"retainedResponsibleFileLocks":[],"dependencies":[],"priority":"high","portfolioValueScore":0,"ownerDevelopmentHold":false,"releaseState":"development-confirmed","status":"blocked","retries":0,"retryPolicy":"UNLIMITED_CAUSAL_REPAIR","maxRetries":null,"ownerDirective":false,"requiresOwnerDecision":false,"protectedChange":false,"paidResourceRequired":false,"productionMode":"AUTONOMOUS_VIBE","supervisionApproved":false,"supervisionContract":null,"supervisionReview":null,"blocker":"work-order-not-runnable","evidence":["central-policy:/tmp/vibe2-main/company-learning/platform-release-roadmap.json","vibe2-auto-planner:game-catalog","release-state:development-confirmed","source-root:web-games/fantasy-survival","owner-resumable-build-up:YES","owner-resumable-build-up-source:catalog-owner-direct","owner-resumable-build-up-perpetual:YES","web-internal-priority:recent-owner-work","web-internal-priority-scope:WEB_ONLY","owner-recent-web-source-revision:bdce59fd1caef47b013741f7d76c6be3f21ce931014d13e6cf56aa214f506e09","diagnostic:LARGE_SINGLE_FILE","diagnostic-key:LARGE_SINGLE_FILE:index.html","diagnostic-severity:high","repair-mode:MODEL","work-package-auto-expande